      "writtenOn": "2024-06-07T21:51:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case you want to use a ifdef TARGET_FLOSS to not had non necessary parameterization to android too, and to make it obvious this settings is only use for floss\n\nSomething like:\n\n```\n#ifndef TARGET_FLOSS\n#ifndef BT_STACK_CLEANUP_WAIT_MS\n#define BT_STACK_CLEANUP_WAIT_MS 1000\n#endif\n#else // define TARGET_FLOSS\n#define BT_STACK_CLEANUP_WAIT_MS 2000\n#endig\n```\n\nThis is straightforward and doesn\u0027t require sysprop module nor other on the side modification.",
      "parentUuid": "3ed2bc54_3ea33c57",
      "range": {
